 who requires specific nutritional formulas.", "QT:QT refers to chemotherapy, which is also associated with complications in patients requiring nutritional support.", "NUTRICIÓN EN EL PACIENTE ONCOLÓGICO:Nutritional guidelines for oncology patients that include recommendations for managing head and neck neoplasias.", "ALIMENTACIÓN:Alimentación refers to the dietary management and nutritional support for patients undergoing treatment for head and neck cancers.", "DEGLUCIÓN:Deglución refers to the act of swallowing, which can be impaired in patients with head and neck cancers.", "NEOPLASIAS DE ORL:", "ÁNGELA MARTÍN PALMERO:Dra. Ángela Martín Palmero is the scientific director and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital San Pedro in La Rioja.", "JULIA OCÓN BRETÓN:Dra. Julia Ocón Bretón is the scientific director and head of the Clinical Nutrition and Dietetics Unit at Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza.", "FENANDO L. CALVO GRACIA:Dr. Fernando L. Calvo Gracia is the author of a clinical case study on nutritional management of a patient with a pancreatic tumor."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}